---
interface Props { where?: string }
const { where = '' } = Astro.props;
---
<h2>Regulars</h2>
<p class="dim">How often people give{where} and how much each superchat is, for cross-channel donors and for people who give on one channel only. Each group is shown as a share of itself, since there are far more one-channel donors. Follows the filters above, but not a selection of people.</p>
<div class="hkey" id="hkey"></div>
<div class="multiples" id="hists"></div>
